  "body": "### Description\n\nI have added `allow_guest_access: true` in my homeserver.yaml. Restarted Synapse. Made sure that a room I am testing with has guests enabled and it is public. This https://chat.trom.tf/#/room/#tromjaro:matrix.trom.tf - yet I cannot join as a guest. What am I doing wrong?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAs mentioned above.\n\n### Homeserver\n\nmatrix.trom.tf\n\n### Synapse Version\n\n1.74.0\n\n### Installation Method\n\nDebian packages from packages.matrix.org\n\n### Database\n\nPostgreSQL\n\n### Workers\n\nSingle process\n\n### Platform\n\nDebian 11. AMD EPYC 7282 16-Core Processor,\n\n### Configuration\n\n_No response_\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\nI apologize but my log file is 500MB in size I cannot share it all here. If necessary I can upload it to my Nextcloud and share the link.\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n_No response_",
